        "complete_written_type": "theorem capped_shift_exponent_bounds {K : ℕ} (hK : 2 ≤ K) {κ : ℝ}\n    (hκ : 0 ≤ κ) (hcap : κ ≤ 1 / (2 * (K : ℝ))) :\n    0 ≤ 1 - 1 / (K : ℝ) ∧ 1 - 1 / (K : ℝ) ≤ 1 ∧\n      (1 + κ) * (1 - 1 / (K : ℝ)) ≤ 1 ∧ κ ≤ 1 := by\n",
